<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  ------				   O/N = 2.56%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  ------				   T/N = 17.92%</p>
<p>		   Oct 11, 1996			Oct 10, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.06%	1 month forward =  7.73%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.15%	2 month forward =  7.14%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.74%	3 month forward =  7.62%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.44%	4 month forward =  8.27%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.60%	5 month forward =  8.53%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.75%	6 month forward =  8.70%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
